This repository is maintained for official free plugins for RIMES.
RIMES provides Chinese text input using the Rime Input Method Engine (librime).
Rime / librime: https://github.com/rime/librime

The Rime reference identifies the host platform's input engine. Individual
plugins have their own component dependencies and attribution records.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and individual plugin documentation.
